@startuml
!include ../theme.puml
title Operations Plane 组件图
left to right direction

rectangle "Agent Kernel 各层" as KERNEL LC_EXTERNAL
package "Operations Plane" LC_OPERATIONS {
  component "TelemetryPipeline" as PIPELINE
  component "Logging / Tracing / Metrics" as TELEMETRY
  component "Health / Diagnostics" as HEALTH
  component "SecurityAudit" as AUDIT
}
rectangle "本地日志 / 审计 / Artifact Adapter" as INFRA LC_INFRASTRUCTURE
rectangle "运维调用方" as OPERATOR LC_EXTERNAL

KERNEL ..> PIPELINE : BND-OPS-001\n脱敏 OperationContext / 遥测
PIPELINE --> TELEMETRY : 有界异步分发
PIPELINE --> AUDIT : 安全事实
TELEMETRY --> HEALTH : 指标与依赖状态
HEALTH --> OPERATOR : OperationsQueryPort
TELEMETRY --> INFRA : Log/Trace/Metric Sink Port
AUDIT --> INFRA : SecurityAuditPort
HEALTH --> INFRA : DiagnosticArtifactPort

note bottom of PIPELINE
  普通遥测允许有界降级；安全审计失败时，
  受保护副作用必须失败关闭。运维不得推进领域状态。
end note
@enduml
